    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# New Section\n",
        "Problem Statement:\n",
        " Walmart wants to analyze customer purchase behavior during Black Friday sales to check if spending habits differ based on gender, marital status, and age group. The aim is to understand whether women spend more than men and how other demographic factors influence total spending.\n",
        "# Goal:\n",
        "The goal of this analysis is to explore Walmart’s sales data to find patterns in customer spending across gender, marital status, and age groups. Using statistical tools like Confidence Intervals and the Central Limit Theorem, we will estimate and compare average expenditure for each group and provide clear business recommendations for targeted marketing and better decision-making."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "ibIfffHQJujB"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Q1:Import the dataset and do usual data analysis steps like checking the structure & characteristics of the dataset."
